{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "data_source_merge_conflict_location",
    "description": "INVALID — RESOLVER-LEVEL (esm-spec §4.7 'A mounted document's data sources'). One catalogue mounted at two sibling edges with different url_substitutions (`a`, `b`): both contribute `segment`, at different resolved locations, and the mounting document does not declare it. Neither may silently win: data_source_merge_conflict, naming the source and both edges."
  },
